"2:38.100">ら</span><span begin="2:38.170" end="2:38.870">ら</span><span begin="2:38.940" end="2:40.080">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">라라라라라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lá lá lá lá lá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лалалалала</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La la la la la</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ra ra ra ra ra</span></p><p begin="2:40.640" end="2:43.170" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.640" end="2:40.880">こ</span><span begin="2:40.880" end="2:41.020">ん</span><span begin="2:41.020" end="2:41.220">な</span><span begin="2:41.220" end="2:41.410">に</span><span begin="2:41.410" end="2:41.710">も</span><span begin="2:41.710" end="2:42.580">美</span><span begin="2:42.580" end="2:42.810">し</span><span begin="2:42.810" end="2:43.170">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此美麗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 아름답고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si beau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan hermoso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So wunderschön</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão belo assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно красиво</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così meravigliosamente bello</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo utsukushiku</span></p><p begin="2:43.490" end="2:46.560" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.490" end="2:43.710">こ</span><span begin="2:43.710" end="2:43.860">ん</span><span begin="2:43.860" end="2:44.060">な</span><span begin="2:44.060" end="2:44.220">に</span><span begin="2:44.220" end="2:44.500">も</span><span begin="2:44.590" end="2:45.280">哀</span><span begin="2:45.280" end="2:45.490">し</span><span begin="2:45.490" end="2:45.590">く</span><span begin="2:45.690" end="2:46.560">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此悲傷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably sorrowful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 슬퍼서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y tan triste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und so unendlich traurig</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão triste assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно печально</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così profondamente triste</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo kanashikute</span></p><p begin="2:47.100" end="2:50.970" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.100" end="2:48.010">涙</span><span begin="2:48.010" end="2:48.230">の</span><span begin="2:48.520" end="2:48.860">行</span><span begin="2:48.860" end="2:49.240">き</span><span begin="2:49.240" end="2:49.460">場</span><span begin="2:49.460" end="2:49.720">は</span><span begin="2:49.950" end="2:50.240">もう</span><span begin="2:50.320" end="2:50.530">無</span><span begin="2:50.530" end="2:50.710">い</span><span begin="2:50.710" end="2:50.970">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水已经无处可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">淚水已經無處可去了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There&apos;s nowhere left for these tears to go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">눈물이 갈 곳은 이제 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mes larmes n’ont désormais plus nulle part où aller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las lágrimas ya no tienen adónde ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Für meine Tränen gibt es keinen Ort mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Já não há para onde as lágrimas possam ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слёзам больше некуда идти</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ormai non c’è più un posto per le lacrime</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namida no yukiba wa mou nai yo</span></p><p begin="2:52.060" end="2:54.520" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.060" end="2:52.300">こ</span><span begin="2:52.300" end="2:52.450">ん</span><span begin="2:52.450" end="2:52.650">な</span><span begin="2:52.650" end="2:52.860">に</span><span begin="2:52.860" end="2:53.040">も</span><span begin="2:53.140" end="2:53.890">騒</span><span begin="2:53.890" end="2:54.050">が</span><span begin="2:54.050" end="2:54.240">し</span><span begin="2:54.240" end="2:54.520">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟是如此喧嚣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">竟是如此喧囂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably restless</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 소란스럽고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tumultueux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con tanto bullicio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So voller Unruhe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão tumultuado assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так невероятно шумно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così pieno di rumore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo sawagashiku</span></p><p begin="2:54.930" end="2:58.050" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.930" end="2:55.040">こ</span><span begin="2:55.040" end="2:55.300">ん</span><span begin="2:55.300" end="2:55.520">な</span><span begin="2:55.520" end="2:55.700">に</span><span begin="2:55.700" end="2:56.040">も</span><span begin="2:56.040" end="2:56.720">愛</span><span begin="2:56.720" end="2:56.960">し</span><span begin="2:56.960" end="2:57.110">く</span><span begin="2:57.190" end="2:58.050">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是如此令人眷恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又是如此令人眷戀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So unbearably dear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이토록 애틋해서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant si cher à mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así tan entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und doch so unendlich kostbar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão querido assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так невероятно дорого сердцу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E così immensamente caro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna ni mo itoshikute</span></p><p begin="2:58.480" end="3:07.440" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.480" end="2:58.890">そ</span><span begin="2:58.890" end="2:59.240">れ</span><span begin="2:59.240" end="2:59.460">で</span><span begin="2:59.460" end="2:59.680">も</span><span begin="2:59.980" end="3:00.210">い</span><span begin="3:00.300" end="3:00.680">つ</span><span begin="3:00.680" end="3:00.930">か</span><span begin="3:00.930" end="3:01.150">は</span><span begin="3:01.410" end="3:01.620">止</span><span begin="3:01.790" end="3:02.170">ま</span><span begin="3:02.170" end="3:02.420">る</span><span begin="3:02.420" end="3:03.550">の</span><span begin="3:03.960" end="3:04.630">で</span><span begin="3:04.860" end="3:07.440">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 终有一天也会停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即便如此 終有一天也會停下吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And yet someday it will all come to an end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 언젠가는 멎어 버리겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant un jour tout cela finira sans doute par s’arrêter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero algún día también se detendrá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und dennoch wird auch das irgendwann enden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim um dia tudo isso vai parar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же однажды это наверное прекратится</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure un giorno tutto questo si fermerà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo itsuka wa tomaru no deshou</span></p></div></body></tt>